⭐ 2. Amazon SES – How to Verify Domain (In Hindi)
📌 Domain Verification Kyu Zaroori?

AWS ko prove karna padta hai ki aap domain ke owner ho. Yeh anti-spam / security ke liye hota hai.

🔧 Steps
Step 1 – Open SES → Verified Identities → Create Identity

Identity type: Domain
Enter: example.com

Step 2 – AWS Aapko 5 DNS Records dega
Record Type	Purpose
TXT (Domain Verification)	Domain Ownership verify karta hai
SPF (TXT)	Sender policy
DKIM (3 CNAME Records)	Email Signing
Step 3 – Go to Route53 → Hosted Zone

Add all 4–5 records.

Step 4 – SES Dashboard

Domain → Status becomes Verified + DKIM: Success

🔥 Result

Aap verified domain se unlimited emails send kar sakte ho.

Better deliverability, spam kam.

⭐ 3. Why Emails Go to SPAM & How to Prevent (In Hindi)
📌 Common SPAM Reasons

❌ SPF record nahi hai

❌ DKIM signing nahi hai

❌ DMARC missing

❌ Poor IP Reputation

❌ High bounce rate

❌ Unverified email/domain

❌ Body contains spam keywords

🛡️ How to Prevent Spam
1. Setup SPF
v=spf1 include:amazonses.com -all

2. Setup DKIM

Enable from SES → Add 3 CNAME records.

3. Setup DMARC

Add one TXT record:

_dmarc.example.com
v=DMARC1; p=none; rua=mailto:postmaster@example.com

4. Sender Reputation Maintain Karna

Bounce rate < 2%

Complaint rate < 0.1%

5. Warm-up Emails

Bulk emails ko dhire dhire bhejo.

