⭐ 5. Simple Notification Service – Send First Notification (Hindi)
📌 SNS Kya Hai?

SNS ek pub/sub (publish-subscribe) messaging service hai jisme:

Publisher → message send karta hai

Subscribers → message receive karte hain

🎯 Use Cases

Alarm notifications

Server alerts

SMS

Email notifications

Microservices communication

⭐ 6. Why Should We Use SNS? – SNS Configurations (Hindi)
📌 SNS Kyu Use Kare?
Feature	Benefit
📨 Fan-out messaging	1 message → multiple subscribers
📡 Multi-protocol	Email, SMS, HTTP, Lambda etc.
💵 Low cost	Very cheap service
📈 Scalable	Billions of messages per day
🔐 Secure	IAM + encryption
🔧 SNS Configuration Types
Configuration	Meaning
Standard Topic	At-least-once delivery
FIFO Topic	Ordered messages
Delivery Retry Policy	Agar endpoint fail ho jaye
Access Policy	Kaun publish kar sakta hai
Encryption (KMS)	Secure messages
