⭐ 8. SNS – HTTP/HTTPS Endpoint Notification (In Hindi)
📌 Use Case

Webhook systems, monitoring, alert systems.

🔧 Flow
SNS TOPIC → HTTPS ENDPOINT → Receive JSON Payload

🔧 Steps
1. Create Topic

Name: http-alert-topic

2. Add Subscription

Protocol: HTTPS
Endpoint: https://yourserver.com/endpoint

3. Confirm Subscription

SNS aapke endpoint pe confirmation JSON bhejega.
You must respond with: SubscribeURL Confirmation

4. Send Message

Topic → Publish → Endpoint receives JSON:

{
  "Type": "Notification",
  "Message": "Server Down!"
}

